---
---
<section id="timeline" class="py-20 relative" style="background: var(--black); border-top: 3px solid var(--yellow);">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="text-center mb-16" data-aos="fade-up">
      <span class="nb-section-label">[ MY JOURNEY ]</span>
      <h2 class="font-display font-extrabold text-[40px] text-white">From curious kid to working developer.</h2>
    </div>

    <!-- Timeline container -->
    <div class="relative">
      <!-- Center line (desktop) / left line (mobile) -->
      <div class="timeline-connector hidden lg:block"></div>

      <!-- Entry 1 — 2025 (left) -->
      <div class="relative flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center mb-16" data-aos="fade-right">
        <div class="hidden lg:block w-1/2"></div>
        <div class="hidden lg:block absolute left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-10 w-[22px] h-[22px]" style="background: var(--green); border: 3px solid var(--black);"></div>
        <div class="lg:w-1/2 lg:pl-12 w-full">
          <div class="nb-card bg-[var(--white)] p-6 relative overflow-hidden" style="border-left: 6px solid var(--green); box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 var(--black);">
            <span class="font-mono text-[64px] font-bold absolute bottom-2 right-4 select-none" style="color: rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">2025</span>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
              <span class="nb-tag" style="background: var(--green); color: var(--black);">2025</span>
              <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-xl text-black">Reka Solusi Teknologi</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="font-display font-bold text-base text-gray-600 mb-2">Full-time Developer</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Building digital solutions for real clients. Taking what I learned into production every day.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Entry 2 — 2023 (right) -->
      <div class="relative flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center mb-16" data-aos="fade-left">
        <div class="lg:w-1/2 lg:pr-12 w-full">
          <div class="nb-card bg-[var(--white)] p-6 relative overflow-hidden" style="border-left: 6px solid var(--blue); box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 var(--black);">
            <span class="font-mono text-[64px] font-bold absolute bottom-2 right-4 select-none" style="color: rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">2023</span>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
              <span class="nb-tag" style="background: var(--blue); color: white;">2023</span>
              <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-xl text-black">PT Teknoreka Inovasi</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="font-display font-bold text-base text-gray-600 mb-2">Internship — Web Developer</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Applied web dev skills in a professional environment for the first time. Learned that real codebases have feelings.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hidden lg:block absolute left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-10 w-[22px] h-[22px]" style="background: var(--blue); border: 3px solid var(--black);"></div>
        <div class="hidden lg:block w-1/2"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Entry 3 — 2022 (left) -->
      <div class="relative flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center mb-16" data-aos="fade-right">
        <div class="hidden lg:block w-1/2"></div>
        <div class="hidden lg:block absolute left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-10 w-[22px] h-[22px]" style="background: var(--yellow); border: 3px solid var(--black);"></div>
        <div class="lg:w-1/2 lg:pl-12 w-full">
          <div class="nb-card bg-[var(--white)] p-6 relative overflow-hidden" style="border-left: 6px solid var(--yellow); box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 var(--black);">
            <span class="font-mono text-[64px] font-bold absolute bottom-2 right-4 select-none" style="color: rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">2022</span>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
              <span class="nb-tag" style="background: var(--yellow); color: var(--black);">2022</span>
              <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-xl text-black">SMKN 2 Kota Magelang</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="font-display font-bold text-base text-gray-600 mb-2">Vocational High School · PPLG Major</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Chose the software development major and never looked back. This is where the obsession became a career path.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Entry 4 — 2019 (right) -->
      <div class="relative flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center" data-aos="fade-left">
        <div class="lg:w-1/2 lg:pr-12 w-full">
          <div class="nb-card bg-[var(--white)] p-6 relative overflow-hidden" style="border-left: 6px solid var(--pink); box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 var(--black);">
            <span class="font-mono text-[64px] font-bold absolute bottom-2 right-4 select-none" style="color: rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">2019</span>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
              <span class="nb-tag" style="background: var(--pink); color: white;">2019</span>
              <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-xl text-black">SMPN 1 Kota Magelang</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="font-display font-bold text-base text-gray-600 mb-2">Junior High School</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Where it all began. Discovered programming between physics homework and bad guitar solos.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hidden lg:block absolute left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-10 w-[22px] h-[22px]" style="background: var(--pink); border: 3px solid var(--black);"></div>
        <div class="hidden lg:block w-1/2"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>